          "@type": "Question",
          "name": "What compliance standards guide your processes?",
          "acceptedAnswer": {
            "@type": "Answer",
            "text": "STS adheres to NIST SP 800-88 Rev. 2 media sanitization guidelines, DoD 5220.22-M wiping standards, and HIPAA Security Rule mandates. Our processes align with California DTSC universal waste requirements to ensure rigorous regulatory compliance across Bakersfield, Kern County, and Central California commercial sectors."
